<title>GREECE: Greek 1M ATHIBOR drops to 11.91 from 12.25 pct.</title>
<headline>Greek 1M ATHIBOR drops to 11.91 from 12.25 pct.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
